{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q111600344","formula":"C₂₁H₁₉N₃O₄","hill":"C21H19N3O4","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":21.0,"H":19.0,"N":3.0,"O":4.0},"names":{"en":"Sabizabulin","uk":"Сабізабулін"},"descriptions":{"en":"Sabizabulin is an investigational new drug that is being evaluated for the treatment of castration-resistant prostate cancer and in SARS-CoV-2 (COVID-19) infections. It is a tubulin polymerization inhibitor. Sabizabulin is chemical compound from the group of indole and imidazole derivatives that was first reported in 2012 by Dalton, Li, and Miller.","uk":"Сабізабулін (англ. Sabizabulin) — хімічна сполука з групи похідних індолу та імідазолу, про яку вперше повідомили Далтон, Лі та Міллер у 2012 році. Сабізабулін вивчається як інгібітор мітозу та хіміотерапевтичний засіб при резистентному до кастрації метастатичному раку простати, та проти вірусу SARS-CoV-2 (який спричинює COVID-19)."},"fame":3,"pubchemCid":53379371,"mass":377.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"COC1=CC(=CC(=C1OC)OC)C(=O)C2=CN=C(N2)C3=CNC4=CC=CC=C43","inchikey":"WQGVHOVEXMOLOK-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"[2-(1H-indol-3-yl)-1H-imidazol-5-yl]-(3,4,5-trimethoxyphenyl)methanone","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"53379371","atoms":47,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-5.723,"y":0.498,"z":-1.301,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.911,"y":-2.297,"z":1.387,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.293,"y":-1.892,"z":0.032,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.763,"y":3.327,"z":0.011,"el":"O"},{"x":3.899,"y":-2.011,"z":-1.18,"el":"N"},{"x":0.685,"y":0.758,"z":-0.292,"el":"N"},{"x":2.289,"y":1.997,"z":0.615,"el":"N"},{"x":3.019,"y":-0.143,"z":-0.366,"el":"C"},{"x":4.42,"y":-0.119,"z":-0.118,"el":"C"},{"x":4.948,"y":-1.303,"z":-0.638,"el":"C"},{"x":2.018,"y":0.873,"z":-0.01,"el":"C"},{"x":2.729,"y":-1.318,"z":-1.02,"el":"C"},{"x":0.068,"y":1.881,"